  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transformative action for the protection of children in urban context - strengthening child protection systems in partnership with GoI, 17 states and multi-sectoral stakeholders, with a particular focus on female street children, who were additionally vulnerable due to the pandemic.</narrative>
